#: prefs.js
msgid "Smart Top Bar"
msgstr "Aqlli yuqori panel"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Shake twice at the top edge to reveal"
msgstr "Ko‘rsatish uchun yuqori chetda ikki marta chap-o‘ngga silkiting"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Hide when maximized or tiled. Never reveal in true fullscreen."
msgstr "Kattalashtirilgan yoki yonma-yon oynalarda yashirish. Haqiqiy to‘liq ekranda hech qachon ko‘rsatmaslik."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Keep the pointer within 3 pixels of the primary screen’s top edge and move left and right twice."
msgstr "Ko‘rsatkichni asosiy ekranning yuqori chetidan 3 piksel ichida tutib, ikki marta chap-o‘ngga harakatlantiring."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Stroke distance"
msgstr "Har bir harakat masofasi"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Logical pixels; larger values reduce accidental reveals."
msgstr "Mantiqiy piksel; kattaroq qiymat tasodifiy ko‘rinishni kamaytiradi."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Gesture time limit"
msgstr "Imo-ishora vaqt chegarasi"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Milliseconds to complete all four alternating strokes."
msgstr "To‘rtta navbatma-navbat harakatni tugatish uchun millisekund."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Hide delay"
msgstr "Yashirish kechikishi"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Milliseconds after leaving; open menus and keyboard navigation keep the bar visible."
msgstr "Chetga chiqqandan keyingi millisekund; ochiq menyular va klaviatura boshqaruvi panelni ko‘rinadigan saqlaydi."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Shortcut: Super + Ctrl + B"
msgstr "Yorliq: Super + Ctrl + B"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Reveal or hide temporarily. Disabled in true fullscreen; press Super to use the overview."
msgstr "Vaqtincha ko‘rsatish yoki yashirish. Haqiqiy to‘liq ekranda o‘chirilgan; umumiy ko‘rinish uchun Super ni bosing."
